curl.nvim
---------

curl scratch buffer for nvim.

INSTILL

  vim.pack.add { "https://github.com/olexsmir/curl.nvim" }

CONFIGURATION

  ---@type curl.Config
  vim.g.curl_config = {
    curl_bin = "curl",   -- curl command
    flags = { "-i" },    -- list of default curl flags
    execute_map = "<cr>" -- keymap used to execute curl command under cursor
  }

USAGE

  # open .curl file
  :e test.curl

  # write some curl command like,
  curl http://localhost:3000/api/ping
  # press <cr> (or your execute_map) on the line with curl command


